# ABP Background Workers

## Creating a Background Worker
```csharp
public class MyWorker : AsyncPeriodicBackgroundWorkerBase
{
    public MyWorker(AbpAsyncTimer timer, IServiceScopeFactory serviceScopeFactory)
        : base(timer, serviceScopeFactory)
    {
        Timer.Period = 60000; // 1 minute
    }

    protected override async Task DoWorkAsync(PeriodicBackgroundWorkerContext workerContext)
    {
        var myService = workerContext.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<IMyService>();
        await myService.DoPeriodicWorkAsync();
    }
}
```

## Registering Worker
```csharp
public override void OnApplicationInitialization(ApplicationInitializationContext context)
{
    context.AddBackgroundWorker<MyWorker>();
}
```

## Integrations
- Hangfire: `Volo.Abp.BackgroundWorkers.Hangfire`
- Quartz: `Volo.Abp.BackgroundWorkers.Quartz`
